      "updated": 1782779246731,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Situation, Task, Action Result\n2. Answer with specific examples of what i've done with concrete details leveraging the technologies used and their impact\n    2.1 Signal and narrate your resume's Google XYZ structure\n3. Audience must receive the signal you are prepared to do the job (not learn on the job)",
