      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "REQUIREMENTS ENGINEERING\nFunctional: core use cases, actors, API contracts, out-of-scope\nNon-Functional (NFRs):\n• Latency: P50/P99 read + write targets\n• Throughput: peak RPS + burst factor\n• Availability: 99.9%=8.7h | 99.99%=52min | 99.999%=5.3min\n• Consistency: strong vs. eventual\n• Scalability: 10× growth horizon\n• Durability: RPO/RTO targets\n• Compliance: GDPR/HIPAA/PCI-DSS\n\nSLA / SLO / SLI\n• SLI: measured metric (e.g., 99.95% up)\n• SLO: internal target (99.9% over 30d)\n• SLA: contractual with financial penalties\n• Error budget = 1 - SLO\n\nCAP THEOREM\n• CP: Zookeeper, HBase, etcd (blocks on partition)\n• AP: Cassandra, DynamoDB (serves stale)\nPACELC:\n• P: partition → Availability vs Consistency\n• E: else (normal) → Latency vs Consistency\n• DynamoDB: PA/EL | HBase: PC/EC\n\nFAULT TOLERANCE PATTERNS\n• Circuit Breaker: open on N failures → fast-fail → probe → reset\n• Bulkhead: separate thread pool per downstream\n• Retry: exp backoff + full jitter, max 3 retries + total deadline\n• Timeout: fail fast at P99 of downstream\n• Fallback: cached data or default response\n\nSDLC ENVIRONMENTS\nDev → Test → Staging (prod-mirror) → Prod\n• Immutable infra: rebuild, don't patch\n• Feature flags: decouple deploy from release\n• Expand-contract: safe DB schema migration",
      "originalText": "REQUIREMENTS ENGINEERING\nFunctional: core use cases, actors, API contracts, out-of-scope\nNon-Functional (NFRs):\n• Latency: P50/P99 read + write targets\n• Throughput: peak RPS + burst factor\n• Availability: 99.9%=8.7h | 99.99%=52min | 99.999%=5.3min\n• Consistency: strong vs. eventual\n• Scalability: 10× growth horizon\n• Durability: RPO/RTO targets\n• Compliance: GDPR/HIPAA/PCI-DSS\n\nSLA / SLO / SLI\n• SLI: measured metric (e.g., 99.95% up)\n• SLO: internal target (99.9% over 30d)\n• SLA: contractual with financial penalties\n• Error budget = 1 - SLO\n\nCAP THEOREM\n• CP: Zookeeper, HBase, etcd (blocks on partition)\n• AP: Cassandra, DynamoDB (serves stale)\nPACELC:\n• P: partition → Availability vs Consistency\n• E: else (normal) → Latency vs Consistency\n• DynamoDB: PA/EL | HBase: PC/EC\n\nFAULT TOLERANCE PATTERNS\n• Circuit Breaker: open on N failures → fast-fail → probe → reset\n• Bulkhead: separate thread pool per downstream\n• Retry: exp backoff + full jitter, max 3 retries + total deadline\n• Timeout: fail fast at P99 of downstream\n• Fallback: cached data or default response\n\nSDLC ENVIRONMENTS\nDev → Test → Staging (prod-mirror) → Prod\n• Immutable infra: rebuild, don't patch\n• Feature flags: decouple deploy from release\n• Expand-contract: safe DB schema migration",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
