      "text": "RENDERING STRATEGIES\n• SSR: HTML generated per request on server\n  + SEO, fast initial paint | - hydration cost\n  Use: dynamic user content, SEO critical\n• SSG: pre-built at deploy time, served from CDN\n  + Fastest, zero server compute | - stale data\n  Use: marketing, docs, blog, static content\n• ISR: revalidate on interval or on-demand\n  Best of SSR + SSG (Next.js revalidate)\n  Use: eCommerce, news, semi-dynamic pages\n• CSR: SPA, bundle fetched once, client renders\n  - Poor SEO, slow initial load | + rich interactivity\n  Use: dashboards, admin tools, auth-only apps\n\nCDN & EDGE\n• Fingerprinted assets: Cache-Control: immutable\n• API: short TTL (30s) + stale-while-revalidate\n• Edge functions: geo-routing, A/B, auth\n\nCORE WEB VITALS\n• LCP < 2.5s: preload hero, SSR above-fold\n• INP < 200ms: avoid tasks > 50ms, use workers\n• CLS < 0.1: explicit image/ad dimensions\n\nPERFORMANCE\n• Code splitting: dynamic import() per route\n• Tree-shaking: ESM modules\n• Lazy loading: images + below-fold components\n• Compression: Brotli > gzip (25% smaller)\n\nSTATE MANAGEMENT (complexity ladder)\n• useState/useReducer: component-local\n• React Query/SWR: server state, auto-revalidate\n• Zustand: simple shared state, minimal boilerplate\n• Redux Toolkit: complex undo/redo, large teams\n\nTESTING\n• Unit: Vitest/Jest (pure functions, hooks)\n• Component: React Testing Library (a11y-first)\n• E2E: Playwright/Cypress (critical user journeys)\n• Visual: Storybook + Chromatic (diff snapshots)",
      "originalText": "RENDERING STRATEGIES\n• SSR: HTML generated per request on server\n  + SEO, fast initial paint | - hydration cost\n  Use: dynamic user content, SEO critical\n• SSG: pre-built at deploy time, served from CDN\n  + Fastest, zero server compute | - stale data\n  Use: marketing, docs, blog, static content\n• ISR: revalidate on interval or on-demand\n  Best of SSR + SSG (Next.js revalidate)\n  Use: eCommerce, news, semi-dynamic pages\n• CSR: SPA, bundle fetched once, client renders\n  - Poor SEO, slow initial load | + rich interactivity\n  Use: dashboards, admin tools, auth-only apps\n\nCDN & EDGE\n• Fingerprinted assets: Cache-Control: immutable\n• API: short TTL (30s) + stale-while-revalidate\n• Edge functions: geo-routing, A/B, auth\n\nCORE WEB VITALS\n• LCP < 2.5s: preload hero, SSR above-fold\n• INP < 200ms: avoid tasks > 50ms, use workers\n• CLS < 0.1: explicit image/ad dimensions\n\nPERFORMANCE\n• Code splitting: dynamic import() per route\n• Tree-shaking: ESM modules\n• Lazy loading: images + below-fold components\n• Compression: Brotli > gzip (25% smaller)\n\nSTATE MANAGEMENT (complexity ladder)\n• useState/useReducer: component-local\n• React Query/SWR: server state, auto-revalidate\n• Zustand: simple shared state, minimal boilerplate\n• Redux Toolkit: complex undo/redo, large teams\n\nTESTING\n• Unit: Vitest/Jest (pure functions, hooks)\n• Component: React Testing Library (a11y-first)\n• E2E: Playwright/Cypress (critical user journeys)\n• Visual: Storybook + Chromatic (diff snapshots)",
