      "text": "Client→CDN (static)→LB (SSL+health)→WAF (OWASP)→API GW (auth, rate limit, route)→Services (stateless HPA)→{Redis (L2 cache), Kafka (async), PostgreSQL (ACID), S3 (blobs)}→{Read Replicas (80% reads), Workers (async consumers), Monitoring (RED+USE+traces)}",
